=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle ran 41% of normal in November to December and 179% in April to May. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 64% on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, with grids 17274 and 17574 down to 55%.</p>"}
